      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 91.28,
      "end": 95.84,
      "en": "Marco, you already told our listeners about one phrase, to dry clean.",
      "zh": "马可，你已经告诉我们的听众一个短语，干洗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 96.16,
      "end": 97.32,
      "en": "So dry cleaned.",
      "zh": "所以干洗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 98.08,
      "end": 104.96,
      "en": "Alright so that's when you take your clothes to a professional who doesn't only wash them, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，那是你把你的衣服带到一个不只洗衣服的专业人士的时候，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 104.96,
      "end": 106.24,
      "en": "You don't just put water and soap on it.",
      "zh": "你不只是在上面放水和肥皂。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 106.52,
      "end": 113.5,
      "en": "They actually put some special chemicals and use special machines to get very hard to remove stains from it.",
      "zh": "他们实际上放置了一些特殊的化学物质，并使用特殊的机器来很难去除污渍。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
