      "end": 114.92,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 114.92,
      "end": 121.33,
      "en": "So this is often what we use when we clean coats or fancy shirts and dresses because you don't want to clean those yourself.",
      "zh": "所以这通常是我们在清洁外套或花式衬衫和连衣裙时使用的，因为您不想自己清洁它们。"
    },
    {
