      "start": 121.36,
      "end": 122.36,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 122.36,
      "end": 123.15,
      "en": "You can't put those in the washing machine.",
      "zh": "你不能把它们放在洗衣机里。"
    },
    {
