      "start": 123.39,
      "end": 123.55,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 123.55,
      "end": 124.85,
      "en": "So this is the dry cleaner.",
      "zh": "所以这是干洗店。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 125.25,
      "end": 126.11,
      "en": "That's the name of the place.",
