    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 126.59,
      "end": 129.73,
      "en": "And the action, what they do is they dry clean clothes.",
      "zh": "而行动，他们所做的是干洗衣服。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 130.01,
      "end": 130.39,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 130.43,
      "end": 130.95,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 132.08,
      "end": 133.08,
      "en": "Alright.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 133.08,
      "end": 136.64,
      "en": "So we take them to the dry cleaners because we want to remove stains.",
      "zh": "所以我们把它们带到干洗店，因为我们想去除污渍。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 136.65,
      "end": 137.03,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 137.15,
      "end": 144.03,
      "en": "So a stain is a mark or some color that does not come off, does not go away.",
      "zh": "所以污点是一个标记或一些不会脱落的颜色，不会消失。"
    },
    {
