      "en": "So it's a verb, it's a noun and an adjective all in one.",
      "zh": "所以它是一个动词，它是一个名词和一个形容词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 175.08,
      "end": 175.31,
      "en": "Easy to remember.",
      "zh": "容易记住。"
    },
    {
