      "en": "To iron.",
      "zh": "铁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 208.92,
      "end": 212.4,
      "en": "To iron means to make something flat with no lines.",
      "zh": "铁意味着使没有线的东西变得平坦。"
    },
