      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 231.28,
      "end": 234.17,
      "en": "So you smooth them out, you flatten them with this object, an iron.",
      "zh": "所以你把它们弄平，用这个物体把它们弄平，铁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
