      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 236.08,
      "end": 242.07,
      "en": "And well, usually if you take them to the dry cleaners, they will iron them and also starch them.",
      "zh": "好吧，通常如果你把它们带到干洗店，它们会熨烫它们并使它们淀粉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 242.44,
      "end": 242.84,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 243.06,
      "end": 251.68,
      "en": "To starch something means to use some powder or chemical to make something stiff or hard.",
      "zh": "淀粉某物意味着使用一些粉末或化学物质使某些东西变得僵硬或坚硬。"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 252.14,
      "end": 256.4,
      "en": "So the noun or the chemical is also called starch.",
      "zh": "所以名词或化学物质也称为淀粉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 256.88,
      "end": 257.16,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 257.48,
      "end": 260.8,
      "en": "So you think of a shirt with many buttons that a man wears to work.",
      "zh": "所以你会想到一件带有许多纽扣的衬衫，一个男人穿上去上班。"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 261.08,
      "end": 266.26,
      "en": "He has a collar around his neck and that needs to be high and tall.",
      "zh": "他的脖子上有一个项圈，需要高高。"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 266.68,
