      "start": 540.76,
      "end": 540.91,
      "en": "It takes some practice.",
      "zh": "这需要一些练习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 224,
      "start": 541.84,
      "end": 544.67,
      "en": "My suggestion is to use the spritzer.",
      "zh": "我的建议是使用 Spritzer。"
    },
    {
      "id": 225,
      "start": 545.32,
      "end": 548.67,
      "en": "In the iron, there's some water that can come out like that.",
      "zh": "在铁中，有一些水可以像这样流出。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 549.4,
      "end": 554.8,
      "en": "Well, if you spray the water, it makes the lines go out for longer.",
      "zh": "好吧，如果你喷水，它会使线路更长。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 556.22,
      "end": 558.44,
      "en": "Because if you iron over that, it's more permanent.",
      "zh": "因为如果你为此熨烫，它会更永久。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 559.04,
      "end": 566.92,
      "en": "I've also seen some sprays sometimes that you can spray your clothes with some special chemical that's not actually starch, but it helps remove the wrinkles quicker.",
      "zh": "我还看到一些喷雾剂，有时你可以用一些实际上不是淀粉的特殊化学物质喷洒你的衣服，但它有助于更快地去除皱纹。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 567.26,
      "end": 567.48,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 568.36,
      "end": 569.36,
      "en": "I don't use that.",
      "zh": "我不使用那个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 569.36,
      "end": 571.02,
      "en": "I use water generally, but they're all available.",
      "zh": "我一般用水，但它们都是可用的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 571.56,
      "end": 571.84,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 572.48,
      "end": 574.18,
      "en": "So that's all the time we have for today.",
      "zh": "好了，今天的节目就到这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 574.4,
      "end": 580.84,
      "en": "If you have any questions or comments, you can visit our comment section on EnglishPod.com and we'll see you guys there.",
      "zh": "如果您有任何问题或意见，您可以访问我们在 Englishpod.com 上的评论部分，我们将在那里见到你们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 581.16,
      "end": 581.72,
      "en": "Bye, everyone.",
      "zh": "大家再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 582.04,
      "end": 590.158,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
